    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views plus a full-size front-right orbit. Stainless cart with four casters, sliding doors, lower wire shelf, bus tub, plus a twin-burner coffee machine with three glass carafes, mugs, canisters and a trailing power lead. The top view confirms the whole load-out is modelled, not textured on. 27.7k tris.",
    "limitations": [
      "Coffee machine and carafes carry an invented DUNN badge, a stand-in for a real brand rather than an actual manufacturer mark.",
      "Supplied fully loaded; remove the props if you need an empty cart."
    ],
